# Script quality

Mirrors: `scripts/web.snapchat.com/scripts/<slug>/{script.js,meta.json}`  
Address: `@handle/web.snapchat.com/<slug>`  
Contracts: `scripts/web.snapchat.com/docs/SCRIPTS.md`

- Validate args; stable return shapes; honest `loggedIn` / `sideEffects`
- One job per script; finite timeouts; empty/not-found as structured success
- Cap list scrapes; delays between open and scrape
- Live cases: `tests/cases.json` + `run-benchmark.mjs`
- Static: `npm test` (ReDuckHunt picks up `tests/**/*.test.js`)
